# --- a file no rule names -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# a new file with no rule yet: test/gates warns (and --list names it under "unmapped"), and runs this small default
# (a CLI smoke, three engine suites, a site build), never every suite. Give the file its rule in the same change.
fallback @cli-smoke test/wake-start.mjs test/message.mjs test/lead.sh @site-smoke
